## Escalation Checklist

Any of the following requires human review before merge:

- [ ] Change would violate a constraint in [INVARIANTS.md](../INVARIANTS.md)
- [ ] Security-sensitive change (auth, credentials, PII handling)
- [ ] Database schema change
- [ ] API breaking change (removed or renamed endpoint, changed contract)
- [ ] Large refactor crossing module boundaries
